  nonce: 432d  # 432d
  message: "Fixed in PR (dev 0c17562292).\n\nBehavioral evidence: `hypergumbo verify-claims --format json` on merged dev, claim host_secret -> network, against the item's own shapes.\n  JS:  const res = await fetch(url, { headers: { Authorization: process.env.API_TOKEN } })  -> violated (1); blocker sink_on_source_line. Was: inconclusive.\n  Py:  resp = requests.post(url, headers={\"Authorization\": os.environ[\"API_TOKEN\"]})        -> violated (1); sink_on_source_line. Was: inconclusive.\n  Py:  r = sock.sendall(os.environ[\"API_KEY\"].encode())  (sock = socket.create_connection(..))  -> violated (1). Was: confirmed_with_caveats. The row collapses a sink_before_source member and a sink_on_source_line member, so it carries the verdict.\n  JS:  const n = acc.push(process.env.API_KEY); console.log(n); return fetch(url + acc[0])  -> violated (1); walk escaped (call_beside_source). Was: confirmed_with_caveats, NO evidence: the walk had removed the flow.\nThe before-verdicts were re-measured on a dev worktree in the same session. Production-path tests are test_taint_source_line_shapes.py (mainstream) and test_taint_source_line.py (core).\n\nFix:\n(a) A sink called on a source line is blocked as `sink_on_source_line`, a new walk blocker, and carries the verdict. sink_before_source and ADR-0052 are unchanged, per the owner.\n(b) Every OTHER call on a source line gets the use-line termination question (_source_line_escapes). One no summary says terminates is an escape, which can only turn False into None. A call that constructs the source's own receiver is excluded (Fernet(key).decrypt(ct)): it runs before the source, and counting it withdrew WI-fasub's same-function sanitizer credit (caught by test_py_with_clause_and_sanitizer_credit).\n\nCorpus A/B (verify-claims, dev vs branch): apollo-server, beads, feast and superset moved no verdict and no evidence count.\nNOT checked: other languages' spellings of (b). The untyped-parameter variant (def go(sock): sock.sendall(...)) still cannot match the sink at all: the INV-fibis untyped-receiver disclosure, a separate limit."  # 432d
